            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "The Trade Marks Registry, Mumbai (Boudhik Sampada Bhawan, S.M. Road, Antop Hill, Mumbai 400037) handles all trademark opposition filings from Pune and Maharashtra. Pune does not have a separate trademark registry. All opposition notices, counter statements, and hearings are processed through the Mumbai office under the CGPDTM framework."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Can I file a trademark opposition from Pune entirely online?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes. Trademark opposition can be filed 100% online through the ipindia.gov.in portal. Form TM-O is submitted electronically with the government fee of Rs 2,700 per class. Hearings are also increasingly conducted online. Patron's Pune office at RTC Silver, Wagholi handles the entire process digitally."
