<!-- SECTION 7: 7-STEP PROCESS -->
<section class="steps-section" id="procedure-section">
    <div class="section-container">
        <header class="section-header" style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:48px;">
            <span class="section-eyebrow">Our Process</span>
            <h2 class="section-title">Trademark Opposition Process in Pune</h2>
            <p class="section-subtitle" style="text-align:left;max-width:100%;">Our Pune team manages the entire trademark opposition process - from Journal monitoring to hearing representation at the Mumbai TM Registry.</p>
        </header>
        <div class="steps-container">
            <div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 1</span><h3 class="step-title">Monitor the Trademark Journal for Conflicting Marks</h3><p class="step-description">Review weekly Trademark Journal for accepted applications conflicting with your brand. For Pune IT companies at Hinjewadi and Kharadi, monitor Class 9 (software) and Class 42 (IT services). Patron sets up journal alerts mapped to your classes and notifies within 48 hours.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Journal alerts set</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>48-hour notification</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="15" y="5" width="90" height="70" rx="6" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="60" cy="35" r="15" fill="#FFF3E0" stroke="#F5A623" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M55 35l5 0M60 30l0 10" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/><text x="60" y="85" font-size="7" fill="#14365F" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Journal Watch</text></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">Monitoring</span><span class="step-number-large">01</span></div></div></div>
<div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 2</span><h3 class="step-title">Analyse Opposition Grounds Under Sections 9 and 11</h3><p class="step-description">Evaluate whether the published mark violates absolute grounds under Section 9 or relative grounds under Section 11. For MIDC Bhosari and Chakan manufacturers, this includes product class overlap and trade channel similarity. Maharashtra PTRC/PTEC records may serve as evidence of trade presence.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Grounds analysed</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Evidence mapped</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="20" y="10" width="80" height="55" rx="6" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.5"/><text x="60" y="30" font-size="7" fill="#14365F" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Sec 9</text><text x="60" y="45" font-size="7" fill="#14365F" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Sec 11</text><rect x="35" y="55" width="50" height="8" rx="4" fill="#E8712C" opacity="0.3"/></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">Grounds Set</span><span class="step-number-large">02</span></div></div></div>
<div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 3</span><h3 class="step-title">Draft and File Notice of Opposition (Form TM-O)</h3><p class="step-description">Prepare Form TM-O with legal grounds, prior mark details and evidence of damage. File via ipindia.gov.in with Rs 2,700 per class. Processed by Trade Marks Registry, Mumbai. No physical visit required - Patron's Pune office handles all filings online.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>TM-O filed online</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Rs 2,700 paid</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="20" y="8" width="80" height="60" rx="6" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.5"/><text x="60" y="28" font-size="8" fill="#14365F" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">TM-O</text><rect x="35" y="38" width="50" height="10" rx="5" fill="#E8712C" opacity="0.7"/><text x="60" y="46" font-size="6" fill="#fff" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Rs 2,700</text><circle cx="90" cy="60" r="8" fill="#E8F5E9" stroke="#25D366" stroke-width="1.2"/><path d="M87 60l2 2 4-4" stroke="#25D366" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">Filed</span><span class="step-number-large">03</span></div></div></div>
<div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 4</span><h3 class="step-title">Serve Notice and Await Counter Statement</h3><p class="step-description">The Registry serves opposition notice on the applicant who has 2 months to file a counter statement. If not filed, the application is deemed abandoned. Patron prepares evidence in anticipation of counter arguments.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Notice served</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Counter deadline tracked</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="15" y="10" width="40" height="55" rx="4" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.5"/><rect x="65" y="10" width="40" height="55" rx="4" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M55 35l10 0" stroke="#E8712C" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><text x="35" y="78" font-size="6" fill="#14365F" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Notice</text><text x="85" y="78" font-size="6" fill="#14365F" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Counter</text></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">Served</span><span class="step-number-large">04</span></div></div></div>
