                        <h3 class="faq-expanded__q">Which Trade Marks Registry handles trademark opposition in Pune?</h3>
                        <div class="faq-expanded__a"><p>The Trade Marks Registry, Mumbai (Boudhik Sampada Bhawan, S.M. Road, Antop Hill, Mumbai 400037) handles all trademark opposition filings from Pune and Maharashtra. Pune does not have a separate trademark registry. All opposition notices, counter statements, and hearings are processed through the Mumbai office under the CGPDTM framework.</p></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-expanded__item" id="faq-2">
                        <h3 class="faq-expanded__q">Can I file a trademark opposition from Pune entirely online?</h3>
                        <div class="faq-expanded__a"><p>Yes. Trademark opposition can be filed 100% online through the ipindia.gov.in portal. Form TM-O is submitted electronically with the government fee of Rs 2,700 per class. Hearings are also increasingly conducted online. Patron's Pune office at RTC Silver, Wagholi handles the entire process digitally.</p></div>
