                    <div class="faq-expanded__item" id="faq-3">
                        <h3 class="faq-expanded__q">What is the trademark opposition fee in Pune?</h3>
                        <div class="faq-expanded__a"><p>The government fee is Rs 2,700 per class for online filing (Rs 3,000 for physical filing). This applies uniformly across all five Trade Marks Registry offices. Professional advisory fees vary based on complexity. Patron offers fixed-price opposition filing packages starting from Rs 8,000 in addition to the government fee.</p></div>
